  "description": "Motor & Performance\n\n500W mid-drive motor with 175Nm torque for effortless hill climbing\n\nSmooth Class 2 pedal assist with optional throttle for instant power\n\nPerfect for urban commuting, errands, and hilly streets\n\nBattery & Range\n\n48V 15Ah LG-certified battery with UL certification\n\nUp to 80-mile range on pedal assist (depends on terrain and rider weight)\n\nRemovable battery for easy charging at home or office\n\nDrivetrain & Gear Options\n\n10-speed chain version: Shimano 10-speed drivetrain for versatile shifting\n\n8-speed chain version: Optional Logan hydraulic disc brakes for enhanced stopping\n\nSmooth and reliable performance for city streets or light off-road paths\n\nComfort & Suspension\n\nErgonomic adjustable handlebar stem for personalized riding posture\n\nHydraulic front fork with 100mm travel to absorb bumps and rough roads\n\nStep-through frame for easy mounting, ideal for seniors and adults\n\nSafety & Extras\n\nHydraulic disc brakes (Logan for 8-speed version) for precise, responsive stopping\n\nIntuitive LCD display with real-time speed, battery, and riding mode\n\nIntegrated lights and bell for urban safety\n\nLightweight yet sturdy frame supports up to 330 lbs\n\nDesign & Versatility\n\nSleek urban styling, suitable for commuting, errands, and city rides\n\nCompatible with rear racks and panniers for groceries or gear\n\nA step-through frame and adjustable stem make it perfect for seniors and adult riders",
